## What this wrapper covers

- login/session persistence in `WebView`
- camera upload from file inputs
- `getUserMedia()` camera and microphone permission handling
- file chooser support including multiple file selection
- PDF/CSV/blob downloads
- passkeys / WebAuthn in WebView
- deep links for `/approve/...`
- pull to refresh
- back button navigation

## Known limitation

This web app's OBD flow in `src/components/InspectionWizard.tsx` uses Web Bluetooth and Web Serial.

A normal Android WebView is not the right place to depend on those advanced hardware web APIs.

Covered in this wrapper:
- camera
- downloads
- approvals
- login
- passkeys
- invoices
- PDFs
- attendance
- normal web app flows

Not covered in a reliable way inside plain WebView:
- OBD BLE / USB scanner flow

If you want the OBD scanner to work inside Android too, build a native BLE / USB bridge as a second step.

